WEBVTT

00:00.200 --> 00:03.400
Okay, my name is Seraphina.
I am from Chicago,

00:03.400 --> 00:06.800
and this event was really amazing,
just seeing different people

00:06.800 --> 00:08.800
with great ideas come together,

00:08.800 --> 00:11.400
who want to build in Ghana
and just do something great back in Ghana.

00:11.400 --> 00:15.800
I am so glad that I came because
I'm leaving with a lot of value.
